error[elab/function-argument-type-parameter-arity-mismatch]: function parameter `h` has 2 type parameters, but passed function `g` has 1
  ┌─ elab/type-functyp-tparam-arity-mismatch.watsup:8:20
  │
4 │ dec $g<T>(T) : T
  │      -- passed function declared here
5 │ dec $caller(def $h<U, V>(nat) : nat) : nat
  │                  -- function parameter declared here
6 │ 
7 │ dec $bad : nat
  │            --- return value of function '$bad' expects 'nat'
8 │ def $bad = $caller(def $g)
  │                    ^^^^^^
  │
  = A passed function must have the same number of type parameters, parameter types, and return type as its function parameter.

